  "definition": "Competent bedrock",
  "effectiveDate": "2008-06-13",
  "historyNote": "#4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96 New. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96 New. #6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08; renumbered by #12075 (formerly We 101.08)",
